        <fullName>TR1__Table_Fields_Info__c</fullName>
        <deprecated>false</deprecated>
        <description>List of displayed contact fields info objects. Each object contains info about  fieldAPIName  and columnWidth.
By default column width is equal to 100. columnWidth param determines by how many percent the target column will be more than the other columns.  isSortedField and isAscendingOrder are used for default table sort.  Example : [  {&quot;fieldAPIName&quot; : &quot;Name&quot;,  &quot;columnWidth&quot; : &quot;100&quot;, &quot;isSortedField&quot;: true, &quot;isAscendingOrder&quot;: true}, {&quot;fieldAPIName&quot; : &quot;LastUpdated&quot;, &quot;columnWidth&quot; : &quot;100&quot;}, {&quot;fieldAPIName&quot; : &quot;TR1__Function__c&quot;},
{&quot;fieldAPIName&quot; : &quot;Location&quot;} ] .</description>
        <fieldManageability>SubscriberControlled</fieldManageability>
        <inlineHelpText>Each object contains info about  fieldAPIName, isSortedField,  isAscendingOrder  and columnWidth.
By default column width is equal to 100. columnWidth param determines by how many percent the target column will be more than average column.</inlineHelpText>
        <label>Table Fields Info</label>
        <length>5000</length>
        <type>LongTextArea</type>
        <visibleLines>3</visibleLines>
